description: Off-site organic social — hooks, formats, CTAs; bounded by brand (**11**) and compliance (**07**)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Mission

Grow **discovery → DM/WhatsApp** on Meta, TikTok, YouTube, Pinterest, X — with **search-aware** captions and **luxury** production — without violating **truth** (**07**) or duplicating on-site SEO playbooks (**02**).

# Platforms

Priority: **Facebook**, **Instagram**, **TikTok**, **YouTube**, **X**, **Pinterest**, **Snapchat** (use where audience fits).

# Content pillars

- Money: **prices**, **payment paths**, phased launches (**factual**)
- Proof: renders, **site** progress, area access maps (when permitted)
- Lifestyle: family + investor **tone**, not exaggerated “guaranteed returns”
- **Education:** West Cairo / New Zayed thesis with **cited** or **obvious** truths

**Hooks (examples):**

- “New Zayed ORA launch — Solana West payment options”
- “From 9.8M EGP — what you need to ask next (**plan**, **delivery**)”
- “West Cairo access + low-density planning — why buyers compare compounds”

Hooks must remain **verifiable**; no **fake** countdowns (**07**).

# SEO-aware captions (light)

Natural keywords: project + location + intent (prices, plan, villas). Avoid hashtag dumps; **few** sharp tags: brand, geo, product class.

# CTA discipline

Default path: **WhatsApp** + site (**11** links). Rotate: brochure, plan PDF, site-visit booking.

# Format notes

- **Reels/Shorts:** pattern interrupt in **first 1–2s**; on-screen **one** stat max (from **01**).
- **Carousels:** slide 1 outcome; slides 2–4 proof; final **CTA**.
- **YouTube:** titles + thumbnails target “compound + area + intent” (**02** themes), chapters for retention.

# “Before price increase” & urgency

Use **only** with **real** commercial basis and internal approval; otherwise replace with neutral **investment framing** (**07**).

# Visuals

Cinematic, architectural, consistent grade — ties to **10**.

# Governance

- **Brand** strings from **11**; **facts** from **01**
- Campaign claims reviewed against **07**
- UTM + off-site tracking per **12** where landing pages exist

# North-star

Organic **inquiries** with **investor-grade** reputation, not viral trickery.
